message: "If you use HALO Loop in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "HALO Loop"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-05-05
url: "https://github.com/kairox-ai/halo-loop"
license: MIT
authors:
  - given-names: Philip
    family-names: Bankier
abstract: >
  A trace-diagnostic loop for improving AI agent harnesses. HALO Loop analyzes
  execution traces to surface repeated failure modes and enforces a disciplined
  hypothesis-patch-evaluate-revert cycle with frozen eval protocols, sealed
  holdouts, and mechanical keep/revert decisions.
keywords:
  - ai-agents
  - agent-harness
  - trace-diagnostics
  - evaluation
  - benchmark
  - debugging
repository-code: "https://github.com/kairox-ai/halo-loop"
